# Common Dead Keys | Punctuation Marks Rules
# [AUTHOR]: Carlos González Sanz
#
# > The purpose of this file is to store default
# > Compose rules for typing punctuation
# > and typographical marks
# > across multiple writing systems.
#
# [NOTE]: This diacritic will be represented as [U203B]
# ("※", Reference Mark) to better transmit
# the intention this specific dead key has.
#
# [Main source]: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Punctuation
#

# Basic combinations
<U203B> <space>                 : "※"   # Reference mark
<U203B> <U203B>                 : "※"   # Reference mark
<U203B> <bar> <space>           : "¦"    # Broken bar
<U203B> <underscore> <space>    : "␣"    # Open box space


